{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc4b The Virtual Buddy \u2013 Bring Your Desktop to Life!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf89 <strong>Now in Early Access!</strong><br>The Virtual Buddy is still growing \u2014 but your digital friend just couldn\u2019t wait any longer! Jump in now and help shape the future together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcac What is The Virtual Buddy?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Virtual Buddy is a <strong>desktop companion simulation</strong> where a digital friend lives on your screen alongside you.<br>Sometimes hungry, sometimes sleepy, sometimes just looking for attention...<br>But always wants to be with you. \ud83e\udde1</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They walk around, relax, respond to your interaction, and occasionally surprise you with unexpected behavior.<br>Whether you're working, gaming, or watching videos \u2014 your digital friend is always there in the corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846780/extras/41c6f59364e0435a69eb76b16e1dbce4.avif?t=1764797433\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846780/extras_big/41c6f59364e0435a69eb76b16e1dbce4.avif?t=1764797433 width=800 height=800 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd11 Key Features</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Online Interaction Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match with your Steam friend and see their pet on your screen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send quick messages with a single tap.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share small gestures of affection with heart sends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave a fun little \u201cbathroom surprise\u201d on your friend\u2019s screen. \ud83d\udca9</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Real-Time Need System</strong><br>Your buddy has needs: hunger, thirst, energy, mood, health, and <strong>toilet</strong>.<br>It needs your attention \u2014 just like a real friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Mini Games</strong><br>Want to have some fun? Play light, enjoyable mini games with your companion and brighten your screen time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddb1\ufe0f <strong>Drag &amp; Drop Interaction</strong><br>Move your buddy anywhere on your screen. Place items like food bowls, toys, and beds wherever you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf81 <strong>Accessories &amp; Decorations</strong><br>Customize your space with fun items to make your desktop feel more alive and personal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf08 <strong>Different Styles &amp; Characters</strong><br>From the very beginning, choose between unique companions \u2014 each with their own looks, vibes, and personalities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udea7 Roadmap</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udccc New Buddies<br>\ud83d\udccc More Mini Games<br>\ud83d\udccc Events &amp; Tasks<br>\ud83d\udccc Decoration Expansions<br>\ud83d\udccc Social Features<br>\ud83d\udccc Customization &amp; Mod Support<br>\ud83d\udccc Steam Achievements &amp; Collections</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Ball Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3846780/185840d58cb17cab680753b02b93f23bcbf879a2.jpg"},{"name":"Bone Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3846780/f3b93aaa35b70afc41d7ff528e2ad5c712b73c7e.jpg"},{"name":"First Bite","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3846780/01c1af98db813b35f143b47be28653ccca832321.jpg"},{"name":"First Sip","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3846780/1472a06640e749a04a620a80f4f2ac914d48f2e3.jpg"},{"name":"Clean Business","path":"https: