toilet</strong>.<br>It needs your attention \u2014 just like a real friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Mini Games</strong><br>Want to have some fun? Play light, enjoyable mini games with your companion and brighten your screen time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddb1\ufe0f <strong>Drag &amp; Drop Interaction</strong><br>Move your buddy anywhere on your screen. Place items like food bowls, toys, and beds wherever you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf81 <strong>Accessories &amp; Decorations</strong><br>Customize your space with fun items to make your desktop feel more alive and personal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf08 <strong>Different Styles &amp; Characters</strong><br>From the very beginning, choose between unique companions \u2014 each with their own looks, vibes, and personalities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udea7 Roadmap</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udccc New Buddies<br>\ud83d\udccc More Mini Games<br>\ud83d\udccc Events &amp; Tasks<br>\ud83d\udccc Decoration Expansions<br>\ud83d\udccc Social Features<br>\ud83d\udccc Customization &amp; Mod Support<br>\ud83d\udccc Steam Achievements &amp; Collections</p>","developers":["TwinPaws"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846780/c9dc47b866dfc493fd47c9fdad4789e20f508082/header.jpg?t=1764797433","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3846780/1638143958/e05b06231db52ca22501d6